// Light attack 3: 30 ticks, the default light attack
// (docs/architecture.md section 11, "模型和动画"): startup 0-10, active
// 10-14, recovery 14-30. Each part has keyframes at its ends, so the
// game can stretch each part on its own without changing the poses
// where they meet.
// Rotations are YXZ degrees about each bone's position along the model's
// axes (+X right, +Y up, -Z forward); see assets/anims/README.md for which
// way each bone turns.
//
// Third light attack: a big cut from above the right shoulder down
// to low on the left, stepping into it with the left foot.
//
// Tick 0: standing. 6: winding up. 10: the start of the swing, the
// blade out on the right. 11 to 14: the swing, one key a tick, the
// blade sweeping right to left (the hit is a sector swept right to
// left, section 11 "命中判定"). 14: the end of the swing, out on the
// left. 20: following through. 25: coming back. 30: standing, for idle
// or the next attack.
// Tip heights (m) in the active part, by tick: 10: 1.87, 11: 1.49, 12: 0.99, 13: 0.53, 14: 0.49.
(
    length: 30,
    looping: false,
    bones: {
        // Down into the stance.
        "hips": (translation: [
            (0, (0.000, 0.000, 0.000)),
            (6, (0.000, -0.060, 0.000)),
